    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0154_48d6032697de.png\" style=\"width: 235px; height: 364px;\" /><br />From free body diagram of bead,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> .... (1)<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> ..... (2)<br />By dividing equation (2) by equation (1)<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>"
